        <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#FAF8F4]/50">15 min free · no card · macOS 14+</p>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-lg text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#FAF8F4]/55">Built by one person — I'm Mohamed. Skilly is <a href="https://github.com/tryskilly/skilly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#FAF8F4]/85">open source</a>, so you can see exactly what runs on your Mac. Stuck or curious? <a href="mailto:mohamed@tryskilly.app" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#FAF8F4]/85">mohamed@tryskilly.app</a></p>
